"B003","root_001560","B003","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0262","ن ه ي","B005","root_001560","B005","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0263","ه د ي","B001","root_001583","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0264","ه ل ك","B001","root_001596","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0265","ه ل ك","B006","root_001596","B006","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0266","ه و ي","B002","root_001609","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0267","ه و ي","B004","root_001609","B004","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0268","ه و ي","B010","root_001609","B010","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0269","و ح ي","B001","root_001633","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0270","و ح ي","B002","root_001633","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0271","و ح ي","B004","root_001633","B004","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0272","و ح ي","B006","root_001633","B006","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0273","و ز ر","B001","root_001643","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0274","و ز ر","B002","root_001643","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0275","و ز ر","B004","root_001643","B004","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0276","و س ع","B001","root_001647","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0277","و س ع","B002","root_001647","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0278","و ف ي","B001","root_001669","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0279","و ف ي","B003","root_001669","B003","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0280","و ف ي","B004","root_001669","B004","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0281","و ق ي","B002","root_001677","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0282","و ل ي","B001","root_001684","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0283","و ل ي","B006","root_001684","B006","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s053-0284","و ل ي","B007","root_001684","B007","resolved_source_exact"]],"review_columns":["anchor_key","source_path","line","ayah_ref","raw_excerpt"],"review_rows":[["a-s053-0099","v12/runs/s053/full_context_control/reader_s053_a_ayah_walk.md",356,"53:29","1. **Reciprocal turning away with unequal objects.** ع ر ض B005 supplies turning one's side away; و ل ي B007 withdrawal; ز ك ر B009 reminder; ر و د B001 will. The command answers a prior turning from reminder, but the two turnings serve different ends. I infer that disengagement blocks an unproductive epistemic loop; the ayah reads as bounded reciprocity, not symmetrical moral equivalence."],["a-s053-0097","v12/runs/s053/full_context_control/reader_s053_a_ayah_walk.md",359,"53:29","4. **Reminder as reputational mention remains secondary.** ز ك ر B004/B007 supplies mention and honorable renown. In a surah contesting names and social inheritance, turning from “our mention” may also reject the authoritative public report. I infer that social discourse can carry reminder, though B009 remains the primary mechanism."],["a-s053-0098","v12/runs/s053/full_context_control/reader_s053_a_ayah_walk.md",359,"53:29","4. **Reminder as reputational mention remains secondary.** ز ك ر B004/B007 supplies mention and honorable renown. In a surah contesting names and social inheritance, turning from “our mention” may also reject the authoritative public report. I infer that social discourse can carry reminder, though B009 remains the primary mechanism."],["a-s053-0099","v12/runs/s053/full_context_control/reader_s053_a_ayah_walk.md",359,"53:29","4. **Reminder as reputational mention remains secondary.** ز ك ر B004/B007 supplies mention and honorable renown. In a surah contesting names and social inheritance, turning from “our mention” may also reject the authoritative public report. I infer that social discourse can carry reminder, though B009 remains the primary mechanism."],["a-s053-0058","v12/runs/s053/full_context_control/reader_s053_a_ayah_walk.md",717,"53:59","1. **Wonder at a report whose cause has been disclosed.** ح د ت B003 supplies report or conversation; ع ج ب B001 wonder at what is unfamiliar or of unknown cause. The demonstrative points to the discourse that has just supplied causal mechanisms and precedents. I infer that continued amazement treats explained consequence as causeless novelty; the ayah reads as a rebuke of epistemic estrangement."],["a-s053-0056","v12/runs/s053/full_context_control/reader_s053_a_ayah_walk.md",718,"53:59","2. **The new occurrence is mistaken for mere novelty.** ح د ت B001 supplies coming into being and B002 recentness; ع ج ب B001 supplies wonder at the unfamiliar. I infer that hearers fixate on the message's new arrival rather than its continuity with earlier warnings (53:56). The ayah reads as criticism of novelty bias."],["a-s053-0057","v12/runs/s053/full_context_control/reader_s053_a_ayah_walk.md",718,"53:59","2. **The new occurrence is mistaken for mere novelty.** ح د ت B001 supplies coming into being and B002 recentness; ع ج ب B001 supplies wonder at the unfamiliar. I infer that hearers fixate on the message's new arrival rather than its continuity with earlier warnings (53:56). The ayah reads as criticism of novelty bias."],["a-s053-0059","v12/runs/s053/full_context_control/reader_s053_a_ayah_walk.md",720,"53:59","4. **A report that polishes the heart.** ح د ت B007 supplies polishing a heart through admonition. The next response of laughter rather than weeping shows resistance to that role. I infer that this discourse is meant to remove inner corrosion; the ayah asks why its abrasive clarification is treated as an oddity."]]}
